<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-CA TROPHY QUARTERFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CA TROPHY QUARTERFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>$800,000 CA Trophy men's tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat 3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
